(5693,0,0,'This is Dalin Forgewright. He fled from Lordaeron when the plague struck, taking his love with him.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Godrick Farsan'),
(5693,1,0,'When he came upon the refugees at the Greymane Wall, he felt it his duty to succor them, sending his woman on to Hillsbrad.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Godrick Farsan'),
