(8887,0,3,'Help us, outsider. <The relic crumbles to dust. A vision of eight Dark Iron dwarves performing some sort of ritual fills your head.>',15,0,100,0,0,0,'A tormented voice'),
(8887,0,4,'He cannot be defeated. <The relic burns to nothing. The memories it held are now your own. This city was destroyed by a being not of this world.>',15,0,100,0,0,0,'A tormented voice'),
