(14873,3,0,'Hmm... That rock is nice, but too small.',12,1,100,1,0,0,'Okla'),
(14873,4,0,'This is a shiney rock. I\'ll put it in my bucket. Ok, I just need a few more...',12,1,100,1,0,0,'Okla'),
(14873,5,0,'I bet my friend Gruk would like this rock for the spear he is making! It\'s very sharp... I hope he likes it.',12,1,100,1,0,0,'Okla'),
