(17424,0,0,'Now, let\'s see....',12,0,100,69,0,0,'Anchorite Paetheus'),
(17424,1,0,'In the process of translating this, I believe I\'ve learned more about the drunken exploits of a certain \'Andrew Clementine\' than about the journal\'s author.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Anchorite Paetheus'),
(17424,2,0,'But, no matter. Mister Clementine\'s... err, \'contribution\' notwithstanding, this seems to be the journal of a man named Nolkai. The entries toward the end describe a brutal battle.',12,0,100,11,0,0,'Anchorite Paetheus'),
(17424,3,0,'Take a look at this passage...',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Anchorite Paetheus'),
(17433,0,0,'These pictographs tell a story. This figure at the beginning, almost looks like one of the creatures we encountered at Azure Watch...',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Vindicator Aalesia'),
(17433,1,0,'No, this can\'t be... It says this creature willingly became a servant of the Legion. He transforms into a satyr and receives the Legion\'s "blessing.',12,0,100,274,0,0,'Vindicator Aalesia'),
(17433,2,0,'We must defeat these satyr, $n. We will not suffer the Legion\'s presence in these lands.',12,0,100,53,0,0,'Vindicator Aalesia'),
(17445,0,0,'Stillpine raiders, the time to strike is at hand! Charge!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Stillpine the Younger'),
(17509,0,0,'Read the tome of divinity I have given you, $n.  When you have learned from the book, speak with me again.',12,7,100,1,0,0,'Jol'),
(17528,0,0,'Fools! Weaklings! Tzerak has no need of your assistance!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Tzerak'),
(17658,0,0,'All hail $N, savior of Azuremyst and Bloodmyst. Hero of the Hand of Argus, champion of the draenei people!',14,0,100,22,0,0,'Exarch Admetius'),
(17693,0,0,'Invaders have breached the defenses!',14,0,100,0,0,10285,'Churn'),
(17703,0,0,'Don\'t you people ever check the mail?',12,7,100,0,0,0,'Messenger Hermesius'),
