(18174,0,0,'Lady Liadrin is bound to find a way. She must.',12,1,100,1,0,0,'Initiate Colin'),
(18174,0,1,'Is... it true, what I\'ve heard?  That it was the Sun King himself?',12,1,100,1,0,0,'Initiate Colin'),
(18174,0,2,'Still, the Blood Knights will endure through this loss. We have no other choice... we must find another source.',12,1,100,1,0,0,'Initiate Colin'),
