(18174,1,1,'I know what you mean... they whisper about us when they think we can\'t hear them. They\'ll get theirs.',12,1,100,1,0,0,'Initiate Colin'),
(18174,1,2,'Jealous, that\'s what they are. They\'re afraid to dedicate themselves to true power.',12,1,100,1,0,0,'Initiate Colin'),
