(18966,0,0,'Soldiers of Azeroth, you now fight against the vile Burning Crusade. And the hopes and prayers of all Light-loving people march with you. In the company of our brave allies and brothers -in-arms you will hold your ground and break the demonic charge. You will stem the destructive tyranny that rages across so many worlds.',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Justinius the Harbinger Aggro'),
(18966,0,1,'With each passing moment, I see the people of Azeroth prove again the reasons we have come. It is with solemn pride that I fight with you, and if I die this day, then I die among friends.',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Justinius the Harbinger Aggro'),
(18966,0,2,'The demons should be in no doubt that we are their nemesis and, though they wish our destruction, it is we who bring about their ruin. Kazzak and his forces will be diminished and defeated by this coalition. And to do this, we must throw at them our bodies and hearts, for they seek no less than the obliteration of this world.',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Justinius the Harbinger Aggro'),
(18966,0,3,'Fight on, good people of Azeroth. And take heart! Your brethren rush to this hellish portal and will soon throw themselves at these demons as you have so bravely done. May the Light keep you!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Justinius the Harbinger Aggro'),
(18966,0,4,'Behold the power of the Light! Grace and glory to the Alliance!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Justinius the Harbinger Aggro'),
(18969,0,0,'Hunters, to me! Let us show these demons what it is to fight and die in Azeroth!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'MELGROMM_HIGHMOUNTAIN'),
(18969,0,1,'The spirits sing to us! They sing the song of battle!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'MELGROMM_HIGHMOUNTAIN'),
(18969,0,2,'Strike true, brothers and sisters! Today our quarry is demons!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'MELGROMM_HIGHMOUNTAIN'),
(18969,0,3,'Once again, we will show this Burning Legion that our world is not for the taking!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'MELGROMM_HIGHMOUNTAIN'),
(18969,0,4,'These fiends will fail! For Azeroth!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'MELGROMM_HIGHMOUNTAIN'),
(18969,0,5,'If it is our fate to die this day, then we will not go easy! Mark me, these demons will fall like wheat!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'MELGROMM_HIGHMOUNTAIN'),
(18969,0,6,'Though your sinews tire and your blood flows from cuts and wounds to this sodden ground, you fight for the spirits of your world. No evil force can stand against us!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'MELGROMM_HIGHMOUNTAIN'),
(18969,0,7,'My brethern, my commands-in-arms! I must go to seek the forces of the Horde and direct them here! Keep your spirits strong, brave hunters! Do not fall to the portal-spawned fiends!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'MELGROMM_HIGHMOUNTAIN'),
