(19178,0,2,'The druids of Nighthaven are holding a great celebration in Moonglade for the Lunar Festival.',12,1,100,0,0,0,'Forsaken Commoner to Forsaken Commoner'),
(19178,0,3,'During the Lunar Festival, we should take time to seek out our elders and consider their wisdom.',12,1,100,396,0,0,'Forsaken Commoner to Forsaken Commoner'),
(19178,0,4,'Legend says that the great beast Omen sleeps in the waters of Lake Elune\'ara in Moonglade, only to appear once a year. But that\'s just a legend.',12,1,100,0,0,0,'Forsaken Commoner to Forsaken Commoner'),
(19178,0,5,'Legend says that the great beast Omen sleeps in the waters of Lake Elune\'ara in Moonglade, only to appear once a year. But that\'s just a legend.',12,1,100,6,0,0,'Forsaken Commoner to Forsaken Commoner'),
(19178,6,0,'We should go trick or treating later.',12,1,100,0,0,0,'Forsaken Commoner to Forsaken Commoner'),
(19178,6,1,'We should attend the next burning of the Wickerman.',12,1,100,0,0,0,'Forsaken Commoner to Forsaken Commoner'),
(19178,6,2,'For the Alliance!',12,1,100,4,0,0,'Forsaken Commoner to Forsaken Commoner'),
(19178,6,3,'Happy Hallow\'s End!',12,1,100,0,0,0,'Forsaken Commoner to Forsaken Commoner'),
(19178,6,4,'I think I\'ve eaten too much candy...',12,1,100,0,0,0,'Forsaken Commoner to Forsaken Commoner'),
(19178,6,5,'I think I\'ve eaten too much candy...',12,1,100,274,0,0,'Forsaken Commoner to Forsaken Commoner'),
(19178,8,0,'Winter Veil just isn\'t the same now, but going through the motions still makes me feel something.',12,1,100,0,0,0,'Forsaken Commoner to Forsaken Commoner'),
(19178,8,1,'Greatfather Winter will leave presents for everyone under the tree in Orgrimmar. I wonder what he\'ll bring me this year.',12,1,100,6,0,0,'Forsaken Commoner to Forsaken Commoner'),
(19178,8,2,'Where are all those wonderful winter hats coming from?',12,1,100,0,0,0,'Forsaken Commoner to Forsaken Commoner'),
(19178,8,3,'I hope I have a chance to visit with Greatfather Winter before Winter Veil is over.',12,1,100,0,0,0,'Forsaken Commoner to Forsaken Commoner'),
(19178,8,4,'Winter Veil just isn\'t the same now, but going through the motions still makes me feel something.',12,1,100,396,0,0,'Forsaken Commoner to Forsaken Commoner'),
(19178,8,5,'I hope I have a chance to visit with Greatfather Winter before Winter Veil is over.',12,1,100,273,0,0,'Forsaken Commoner to Forsaken Commoner'),
(19178,8,6,'Where are all those wonderful winter hats coming from?',12,1,100,273,0,0,'Forsaken Commoner to Forsaken Commoner'),
(19178,8,7,'Winter Veil just isn\'t the same now, but going through the motions still makes me feel something.',12,1,100,6,0,0,'Forsaken Commoner to Forsaken Commoner'),
(19178,8,8,'The goblins of Smokywood Pastures always have such wonderful treats for sale this time of year.',12,1,100,273,0,0,'Forsaken Commoner to Forsaken Commoner'),
(19178,8,9,'Greatfather Winter will leave presents for everyone under the tree in Orgrimmar. I wonder what he\'ll bring me this year.',12,1,100,396,0,0,'Forsaken Commoner to Forsaken Commoner'),
(19316,0,0,'Tear it down, soldiers! We\'re shippin\' this thing back to Stormwind!',12,7,100,22,0,0,'Field Marshal Rohamus'),
(19316,0,1,'We\'re gonna melt this hunk of junk down and make weapons with the ingots! Let\'s see how the Legion likes a taste of fel reaver served up Alliance style!',12,7,100,22,0,0,'Field Marshal Rohamus'),
(19316,0,2,'Well done, soldiers! We weren\'t about to let the filthy animals of the Horde show us up!',12,7,100,22,0,0,'Field Marshal Rohamus'),
(19316,0,3,'Let them throw another one of these overgrown tin cans at us! We\'ll show them what the Alliance is made of!',12,7,100,22,0,0,'Field Marshal Rohamus'),
(19380,0,0,'Hurry up with that axe, you! I want it sharp enough to cut the wind!',12,1,100,60,0,1040,'Guard Untula to 0'),
(19380,0,1,'If you\'re no good at fixing, we\'ll see if you\'re good for eating. Now WORK!',12,1,100,5,0,0,'Guard Untula to 0'),
(19383,0,0,'I don\'t understand you!',12,7,100,18,0,0,'Captured Gnome to Guard Untula'),
(19383,0,1,'Please don\'t beat me!',12,7,100,33,0,0,'Captured Gnome to Guard Untula'),
(19447,0,0,'Light, lead the fallen from untruth to truth, from darkness to Light and from death to immortality.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Brother Daniels'),
(19447,1,0,'Light be with you now and forever.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Brother Daniels'),
(19447,2,0,'Light, give me strength.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Brother Daniels'),
(19447,3,0,'The priest kneels in silent prayer.',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Brother Daniels'),
(19527,0,0,'%s absorbs the fire energy of the attack.',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Vacillating Voidcaller'),
(19527,1,0,'%s absorbs the arcane energy of the attack.',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Vacillating Voidcaller'),
(19527,2,0,'%s absorbs the frost energy of the attack.',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Vacillating Voidcaller'),
(19527,3,0,'%s absorbs the holy energy of the attack.',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Vacillating Voidcaller'),
(19527,4,0,'%s absorbs the nature energy of the attack.',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Vacillating Voidcaller'),
(19527,5,0,'%s absorbs the shadow energy of the attack.',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Vacillating Voidcaller'),
(19561,0,0,'I\'m blind, you stupid sow-spawn, not deaf. Don\'t even think about it.',12,1,100,1,0,0,'Thrallmar Grunt'),
(19569,0,0,'I hope those blood elves across the way don\'t think that I\'m spying on them!',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Netherologist Coppernickels'),
(19569,1,0,'If I were smart, I\'d be selling this research for a seat on the rocket ship.  I have a feeling we\'re going to need to get out of here soon!',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Netherologist Coppernickels'),
(19569,2,0,'If this is right, we don\'t have long! Oh well.',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Netherologist Coppernickels'),
(19569,3,0,'This is the last time that I buy second-hand equipment from an ethereal!',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Netherologist Coppernickels'),
(19610,9,0,'I have another reading from the nether.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(19612,0,0,'Well hand it over and let\'s see what you\'ve got!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(19612,1,0,'Great Gazlowe!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(19616,0,0,'%s howls in response to Malukaz\'s call.',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Terokkar Wolf Spirit'),
(19616,1,0,'%s expresses its approval.',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Terokkar Wolf Spirit'),
(19647,0,0,'%s roars in defiance.',16,0,100,15,0,0,'Thrall'),
(19647,1,0,'No, old friend. You\'ve freed us all...',12,0,100,0,0,10631,'Thrall'),
(19667,0,0,'Hail, Gezhe!  Seventeen more orders have been placed in the Hara\'samid Sector.  The markets of heavy veldarite have all but collapsed, as you predicted.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Consortium Nether Runner'),
(19667,0,1,'Heraazi exports are on the rise, sir.  We\'ve already bribed the appropriate taxation officers and contraband will begin to arrive within days.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Consortium Nether Runner'),
(19667,1,0,'By your leave, sir.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Consortium Nether Runner'),
(19672,0,0,'It is if I\'m not the one that\'s going to be sent in to test it... Otherwise,, no.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Consortium Engineer'),
(19672,0,1,'What does that mean anyway? Ready? Can it ever be ready?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Consortium Engineer'),
(19672,0,2,'I\'m giving her all that I\'ve got,, captain. I don\'t think she can take much more of this!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Consortium Engineer'),
(19672,0,3,'I can\'t bang on this device any faster,, captain! My wrapping is already beginning to unravel!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Consortium Engineer'),
(19672,0,4,'Will you stop asking that?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Consortium Engineer'),
(19672,0,5,'Why don\'t you pick up a hammer and start banging on these structures instead of asking us if it\'s done every 5 minutes?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Consortium Engineer'),
(19672,0,6,'I\'ve had just about enough of your incessant whining,, captain. What are you even a captain of? I mean, the nerve!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Consortium Engineer'),
(19673,0,0,'I don\'t get paid enough for this nonsense.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Consortium Engineer'),
(19673,0,1,'Here goes nothing!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Consortium Engineer'),
(19673,0,2,'This is gonna leave a mark...',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Consortium Engineer'),
(19673,0,3,'If I make it through, I expect a pay raise.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Consortium Engineer'),
(19673,1,0,'%s runs his hands across his body to make sure everything is intact.',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Consortium Engineer'),
(19673,2,0,'I made it! I made it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Consortium Engineer'),
(19674,0,0,'I don\'t give a damn what Shaffar\'s ethereals have placed over the entrance to the Mana-Tombs. You will work until those wards are removed and the Consortium can move in safely and take what\'s rightfully ours!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Nexus-Prince Haramad'),
(19674,0,1,'I don\'t pay you engineers exorbitant amounts of gold so that I can hear the words \'no\' or \'can\'t\' exit your wrappings. Bring that barrier down or you\'ll find yourselves working the energy reclamation line on X-17.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Nexus-Prince Haramad'),
(19674,0,2,'I\'m close to the edge, Morphalius. Another screw up and it\'ll be you running through that portal for Kaftiz\'s tests.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Nexus-Prince Haramad'),
(19676,0,0,'Is that damned thing safe to go through yet?',12,0,100,1,0,0,'"Captain" Kaftiz'),
(19676,0,1,'Is it done yet? What is taking so damned long?',12,0,100,1,0,0,'"Captain" Kaftiz'),
(19676,0,2,'You know, we could easily replace you with goblins. Is that what you want???',12,0,100,1,0,0,'"Captain" Kaftiz'),
(19676,0,3,'I can\'t believe you imbeciles went to school for this! Does anybody here know what they\'re doing?',12,0,100,1,0,0,'"Captain" Kaftiz'),
(19676,1,0,'Alright, it looks safe. Get in there, engineer!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'"Captain" Kaftiz'),
(19676,2,0,'%s shrugs.',16,0,100,0,0,0,'"Captain" Kaftiz'),
(19676,2,1,'%s shakes his head in disapproval.',16,0,100,0,0,0,'"Captain" Kaftiz'),
(19676,3,0,'Oh well,, back to the drawing board.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'"Captain" Kaftiz'),
(19676,3,1,'I didn\'t like him much anyway. Too much talk,, not enough \'do.\'',12,0,100,1,0,0,'"Captain" Kaftiz'),
(19676,3,2,'Damnit. How are we ever going to get through their security measures?',12,0,100,1,0,0,'"Captain" Kaftiz'),
(19676,3,3,'Nice going you incompetent morons! Another one of our engineers vaporized!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'"Captain" Kaftiz');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `creature_text` (`entry`,`groupid`,`id`,`text`,`type`,`language`,`probability`,`emote`,`duration`,`sound`,`comment`) VALUES
(19676,3,4,'Thankfully,, there\'s a steady stream of these fools chomping at the bit to get in here.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'"Captain" Kaftiz'),
(19684,1,0,'Khadgar himself is showing you around?  You must have made a good impression, $n.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Haggard War Veteran'),
(19737,0,0,'The ship\'s not ready yet.  We still need to calibrate the fuse length to make sure that it doesn\'t burn out and leave you up there alone.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Engineering Crewmember'),
(19737,1,0,'Essentially, it\'s going to be a long, long time till we are ready to launch.  Maybe you should just head back home to your family.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Engineering Crewmember'),
(19737,2,0,'Why not? A family can give you strength.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Engineering Crewmember'),
(19737,3,0,'Couldn\'t you raise them?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Engineering Crewmember'),
(19737,4,0,'Well, it\'s like I said; it\'s going to be a while before we get this ship ready for flight.  We\'ll keep you informed.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Engineering Crewmember'),
(19776,0,0,'All my bags are packed, I\'m ready to go.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Experimental Pilot'),
(19776,1,0,'You need to do what? All this science, I don\'t understand... Look, this is just my job, five days a week.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Experimental Pilot'),
(19776,2,0,'I can\'t. I\'m not the man they think I am at home.  Besides, I didn\'t bring them out here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Experimental Pilot'),
(19776,3,0,'This isn\'t the kind of place to raise your kids. It\'s cold, and there\'d be no one to raise them.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Experimental Pilot'),
(19776,4,0,'Oh no, no, no... I\'m a rocket man.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Experimental Pilot'),
(19932,0,0,'Something very, very disturbing. We\'re starting to see more of them across the timeways.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Andormu'),
(19932,1,0,'Nozari, I\'m not talking about a greedy wizard looking to improve his station in life by making a small adjustment to the past.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Andormu'),
(19932,2,0,'These beings aren\'t giving themselves the winning numbers for the Stormwind lottery, dear.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Andormu'),
(19932,3,0,'My apologies, Nozari. I have been a bit \'on edge\' as of late. These creatures are attempting to alter the timeways.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Andormu'),
(19932,4,0,'You do recall the last time that this occurred, yes? Let us hope that the master need not be involved.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Andormu'),
(19932,5,0,'Absolutely not. We must not place ourselves at risk. With the master away, we are all that is in place to keep the stream intact. Others are due to arrive any moment now. Heroes and adventurers from Azeroth...',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Andormu'),
(19933,0,0,'Fascinating. What is it, Andormu?',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Nozari'),
(19933,1,0,'Hrm, are they tampering with the timeways?',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Nozari'),
(19933,2,0,'I hate it when you speak to me in that manner. I am your equal in every way, brother. Remember that the next time you are trapped amidst a temporal vortex, crying for help.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Nozari'),
(19933,3,0,'Shall we?',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Nozari'),
(19933,4,0,'%s nods.',16,0,100,1,0,0,'Nozari'),
(19938,0,0,'A flickering image of a female blood elf commander appears. From the surroundings, you can tell she must be inside Tempest Keep.',16,0,100,1,0,0,'Image of Commander Sarannis'),
(19938,1,0,'The blood elf doesn\'t appear to be a magister, but perhaps she holds something that is the key to the tower\'s curse.',16,0,100,25,0,0,'Image of Commander Sarannis'),
(19983,0,0,'Stupid ogre. You all need to be taught a lesson.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Vekh\'nir Stormcaller'),
(19983,0,1,'If freedom is what you seek, freedom is what you shall find.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Vekh\'nir Stormcaller'),
(19983,0,2,'You ogres are disposable.  That being said, it is time to take out the garbage.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Vekh\'nir Stormcaller'),
(19983,0,3,'I tire of these ogres. We should wipe them out, all of them.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Vekh\'nir Stormcaller'),
(19983,0,5,'Do any of you other ogres want to join your friend?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Vekh\'nir Stormcaller'),
(20102,0,0,'During the Lunar Festival, we should take time to seek out our elders and consider their wisdom.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Goblin Commoner to Goblin Commoner'),
(20102,0,1,'Legend says that the great beast Omen sleeps in the waters of Lake Elune\'ara in Moonglade, only to appear once a year. But that\'s just a legend.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Goblin Commoner to Goblin Commoner'),
(20102,0,2,'Have you seen the fireworks? This is the best time of year to buy them.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Goblin Commoner to Goblin Commoner'),
(20102,0,3,'The druids of Nighthaven are holding a great celebration in Moonglade for the Lunar Festival.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Goblin Commoner to Goblin Commoner'),
(20102,6,0,'We should go trick or treating later.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Goblin Commoner to Goblin Commoner'),
(20102,6,1,'There MUST be a way to make more money off of this holiday.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Goblin Commoner to Goblin Commoner'),
(20102,6,2,'The innkeepers are mad to be giving away treats for free.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Goblin Commoner to Goblin Commoner'),
(20102,6,3,'For the Alliance! Wait... the Horde! Wait... which was I again?',12,0,100,4,0,149,'Goblin Commoner to Goblin Commoner'),
(20102,8,0,'Where are all those wonderful winter hats coming from?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Goblin Commoner to Goblin Commoner'),
(20102,8,1,'Ah, the Winter Wondervolt. What will we think of next?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Goblin Commoner to Goblin Commoner'),
(20102,8,2,'The goblins of Smokywood Pastures always have such wonderful treats for sale this time of year.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Goblin Commoner to Goblin Commoner'),
(20102,8,3,'Ah, the Winter Wondervolt. What will we think of next?',12,0,100,274,0,0,'Goblin Commoner to Goblin Commoner'),
(20232,0,0,'Welcome to Shatter Point, $n!  I hope you survive the experience!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Wing Commander Gryphongar'),
(20244,0,0,'%s picks up a sea shell.',16,10,100,0,0,0,'Nova'),
(20244,0,1,'%s holds a sea shell up to her ear.',16,10,100,0,0,0,'Nova'),
(20244,0,2,'%s shakes the dirt loose from the shell.',16,10,100,0,0,0,'Nova'),
(20244,1,0,'I think I can see the Sunwell from here!',12,10,100,0,0,0,'Nova'),
(20244,1,1,'Can you really hear the ocean from one of these shells?',12,10,100,0,0,0,'Nova'),
(20244,1,2,'Oooh! Look, a shiny one!',12,10,100,1,0,0,'Nova'),
(20244,1,3,'Jane will love this one!',12,10,100,1,0,0,'Nova'),
(20345,0,0,'Keep your voices down. There are strangers about...',12,0,100,1,0,0,' Mograine - 1'),
(20345,1,0,'Brothers and sisters, I have called you here today to discuss the fate of Lordaeron.',12,0,100,1,0,0,' Mograine - 2'),
(20345,2,0,'I hear things... Things that should not be.',12,0,100,1,0,0,' Mograine - 3'),
(20345,3,0,'The dead rise... Undead, from the frozen northlands. Whole cities have gone missing. I...',12,0,100,1,0,0,' Mograine - 4'),
(20345,4,0,'I have heard that Northrend is lost...',12,0,100,274,0,0,' Mograine - 5'),
(20345,5,0,'We must stand at the ready. I have faced undead before. They are ruthless killing machines, devoid of any emotion or compassion.',12,0,100,1,0,0,' Mograine - 6'),
(20345,6,0,'Propose? I propose that we prepare. That we prepare our loved ones, family and friends for the possibility of an undead holocaust.',12,0,100,6,0,0,' Mograine - 7'),
(20345,7,0,'And there is this...',12,0,100,6,0,0,' Mograine - 8'),
(20345,8,0,'I have had this object in my possession for 10 years. Since Blackrock Spire...',12,0,100,1,0,0,' Mograine - 9'),
(20345,9,0,'I wrested it free from the remains of an orc lieutenant - a dark caster... It is from their homeworld.',12,0,100,1,0,0,' Mograine - 10'),
(20345,10,0,'Do not get too close. I laid a hand upon it once... Only once and never again. The memories of that day still linger.',12,0,100,1,0,0,' Mograine - 11'),
(20345,11,0,'I surmise that this object is the living embodiment of shadows... darkness... It is a manifestation. It is a void.',12,0,100,1,0,0,' Mograine - 12'),
(20345,12,0,'No, old friend, it is very relevant.',12,0,100,1,0,0,' Mograine - 13'),
(20345,13,0,'Let me ask you this, brothers and sisters: Can good exist without evil? Can there be light without dark?',12,0,100,1,0,0,' Mograine - 14'),
(20345,14,0,'And if that answer is no, then could it be possible that because this artifact exists, its polar opposite must also exist?',12,0,100,25,0,0,' Mograine - 15'),
(20345,15,0,'Could you imagine what the material manifestation of the Light could do against the undead?',12,0,100,1,0,0,' Mograine - 16'),
(20345,16,0,'It consumed the Light!',12,0,100,25,0,0,' Mograine - 17'),
(20345,17,0,'BY THE LIGHT! Could it be? Could this be it?',12,0,100,5,0,0,' Mograine - 18'),
(20345,18,0,'I must know... I will know.',12,0,100,5,0,0,' Mograine - 19'),
(20345,19,0,'I... It... It is beautiful. What I felt when I touched it... The Light coursed through me and I through it... It healed my spirit.',12,0,100,1,0,0,' Mograine - 20'),
(20345,20,0,'Let us never again speak of this day. Our enemies are many. They need not know we hold such artifacts.',12,0,100,1,0,0,' Mograine - 21'),
(20345,21,0,'I have seen it... From this blessed crystal we will forge a weapon. This weapon will hold inside it a piece of each of us... And when it is used against undead, it shall cast them down. And in its wake, it will leave only ashes...',12,0,100,1,0,0,' Mograine - 22'),
(20345,22,0,'%s lowers his voice to a whisper.',16,0,100,0,0,0,' Emote - 1'),
(20345,23,0,'Gasps can be heard throughout the room.',16,0,100,0,0,0,' Emote - 2'),
(20345,25,0,'%s unlocks the chest.',16,0,100,25,0,0,' Emote - 4'),
(20345,26,0,'%s removes the gauntlet from his right arm and shows everyone his mangled hand.',16,0,100,0,0,0,' Emote - 5'),
(20345,27,0,'%s shakes his head.',16,0,100,0,0,0,' Emote - 6'),
(20345,28,0,'Shock then silence overtakes the crowd.',16,0,100,0,0,0,' Emote - 7'),
(20345,29,0,'%s reaches out to touch the light crystal.',16,0,100,25,0,0,' Emote - 8'),
(20345,30,0,'%s puts the crystal back inside the chest.',16,0,100,0,0,0,' Emote - 9'),
(20346,0,0,'I do not see how this evil artifact is relevant to the undead. We must destroy it!',12,0,100,5,0,0,' Isillien - 1'),
(20346,1,0,'Nonsense, Mograine! It must be destroyed!',12,0,100,5,0,0,' Isillien - 2'),
(20346,2,0,'Your hand! It is healed!',12,0,100,25,0,0,' Isillien - 3'),
(20346,3,0,'The Ashbringer...',12,0,100,66,0,0,' Isillien - 4'),
(20347,0,0,'By the Light! What is it?',12,0,100,25,0,0,' Abbendis - 1'),
(20347,1,0,'The Ashbringer...',12,0,100,66,0,0,' Abbendis - 2'),
(20348,0,0,'Is... Is it getting lighter? Its coloration... It is changing.',12,0,100,1,0,0,' Fairbanks - 1'),
(20348,1,0,'The Ashbringer...',12,0,100,66,0,0,' Fairbanks - 2'),
(20349,0,0,'Aye, I\'ve battled them as well. We are ill-prepared as a kingdom to withstand such an assault.',12,0,100,1,0,0,' Tirion - 1'),
(20349,1,0,'Impossible!',12,0,100,5,0,0,' Tirion - 2'),
(20349,2,0,'The Ashbringer...',12,0,100,66,0,0,' Tirion - 3'),
