(24252,0,1,'It\'s hard work putting these things together!',12,1,100,0,0,0,'"Hacksaw" Jenny'),
(24283,0,0,'Right, that should do it. I think ...hic.',12,7,100,396,0,0,'Peppy Wrongnozzle to Player'),
(24316,0,0,'A rune on %s begins to glow brightly!',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Iron Rune Sentinel'),
(24371,0,0,'I have fallen! Fear not, brethren! Let nothing keep you from the Stoneforge!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Megalith'),
(24381,0,0,'Arise from the earth, my brothers!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Megalithe'),
(24381,1,0,'Our iron masters have a mission for us!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Megalithe'),
(24381,2,0,'Follow me into the mountains to carry out the plan of the masters!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Megalithe'),
(24381,3,0,'We will not fail!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Megalithe'),
(24398,0,0,'Yeouch! Watch where you throw that stuff!',14,7,100,0,0,0,'Steel Gate Excavator'),
(24642,1,0,'What ...hic?!',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Drunken Northsea Pirate'),
(24642,2,0,'That\'s it... no more grog for me!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Drunken Northsea Pirate'),
(24735,0,0,'Hi, William, what\'s up?',12,7,100,3,0,0,'Becanna Edune'),
(24735,1,0,'Ah, thank you! I\'ll be sure to go get them soon.',12,7,100,1,0,0,'Becanna Edune'),
(24735,2,0,'Nah, I can handle it. Thanks.',12,7,100,274,0,0,'Becanna Edune'),
(24736,0,0,'Oh, these apples are utterly delicious!',12,7,100,7,0,0,'Sulan Dunadaire'),
(24736,1,0,'My brother simply must try these.',12,7,100,0,0,0,'Sulan Dunadaire'),
(24737,1,0,'What? Why do you want me to do it?',12,7,100,6,0,0,'William Dunadaire'),
(24737,2,0,'Alright, I\'ll tell her.',12,7,100,1,0,0,'William Dunadaire'),
(24737,3,0,'%s takes a deep breath.',16,0,100,0,0,0,'William Dunadaire'),
(24737,4,0,'Odd, she\'s usually here...',12,7,100,0,0,0,'William Dunadaire'),
(24737,5,0,'Hi, uh, Becanna, I mean... uh, Elenna found some herbs! Can you go pick them up?',12,7,100,24,0,0,'William Dunadaire'),
(24737,6,0,'Thanks! If you uh, need any help, just come pick me up... I mean, come get me and I\'ll help!',12,7,100,24,0,0,'William Dunadaire'),
(24737,7,0,'%s turns slightly red and walks away.',16,0,100,0,0,0,'William Dunadaire'),
(24737,8,0,'Thanks, but I\'m not very hungry right now.',12,7,100,274,0,0,'William Dunadaire'),
(24738,0,0,'William, I saw a fresh growth of herbs out on the ridge. Go ask Becanna to pick them up.',12,7,100,1,0,0,'Elenna Edune'),
(24738,1,0,'Come on, just do it.',12,7,100,5,0,0,'Elenna Edune'),
(24738,2,0,'Come on, Goodie, lets go scout the area.',12,2,100,0,0,0,'Elenna Edune'),
(24784,0,0,'There we go, $n! This fat\'ll do the trick fer sure! And now for some real swabbin\'!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Scuttle Frostprow'),
(24784,1,0,'Look at \'em go! Spotless!',12,0,100,4,0,0,'Scuttle Frostprow'),
(24833,0,0,'Thank you, Mr. Kowalski! You may return to your post to oversee docking!',12,7,100,0,0,0,'Captain "Stash" Torgoley'),
(24833,1,0,'Well done, all. Please bring us safely to our next port.',12,7,100,0,0,0,'Captain "Stash" Torgoley'),
(24835,0,0,'Thank you, Mr. Henders.',12,7,100,0,0,0,'First Mate Kowalski'),
(24835,1,0,'Bring us into port, please, Mr. Mehran.',12,7,100,0,0,0,'First Mate Kowalski'),
(24835,2,0,'Captain Stash! We\'ll be arriving shortly, sir!',12,7,100,0,0,0,'First Mate Kowalski'),
(24837,0,0,'Aye aye, Mr. Kowalski.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Navigator Mehran'),
(24838,0,0,'Land ho, Mr. Kowalski! Port is in sight, sir!',12,7,100,0,0,0,'Sailor Henders'),
