(28890,1,1,'Is Gothik the Harvester going to have to choke a geist?',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Gothik the Harvester'),
(28890,2,0,'Death is the only escape!',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Gothik the Harvester'),
(28913,0,0,'What, Orbaz? That he\'s a blood elf?',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Tharassian'),
(28913,1,0,'In life we were hated enemies - this is true...',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Tharassian'),
(28913,2,0,'But in death... We are the children of the damned. The orphaned sons and daughters of the Scourge.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Tharassian'),
(28913,3,0,'In death we are brothers.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Tharassian'),
(28914,1,0,'Why do you care, Thassarian?',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Orbaz Bloodbane'),
(28914,2,0,'His weakness led to his capture.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Orbaz Bloodbane'),
(28914,3,0,'Only the strong should survive. Not to mention...',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Orbaz Bloodbane'),
(28914,4,0,'To hell with you, Thassarian.',12,0,100,25,0,0,'Orbaz Bloodbane'),
(28951,0,0,'Welcome!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Breanni'),
(28951,0,1,'Greetings, $c.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Breanni'),
(28951,0,2,'Greetings! Please have a look around.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Breanni'),
(28951,0,3,'Let me know if you need help finding anything, $c.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Breanni'),
(28951,0,4,'Welcome. May I help you find something?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Breanni'),
(29089,0,0,'%s falls asleep.',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Mini-Tyrael'),
(29089,1,0,'%s becomes enraged.',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Mini-Tyrael'),
(29112,0,0,'Flattery will get you nowhere.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Gothik the Harvester'),
(29112,1,0,'Don\'t be ridiculous. Where would you even go if I did spare you? We just finished eradicating your civilization, remember?',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Gothik the Harvester'),
(29112,2,0,'Oh yes. Immensely. The pain will probably render you unconscious - hence the vat of slime you\'re floating in!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Gothik the Harvester'),
(29112,3,0,'That\'s how you know it\'s working.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Gothik the Harvester'),
(29112,4,0,'You idiot! That\'s What I\'m Doing Right Now!',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Gothik the Harvester'),
(29112,5,0,'I AM going to kill you. What\'s the rush?',12,0,100,6,0,0,'Gothik the Harvester'),
(29113,0,0,'We need more flesh!',14,0,100,5,0,0,'Noth the Plaguebringer'),
(29113,0,1,'Double your efforts! The final assault draws near!',14,0,100,5,0,0,'Noth the Plaguebringer'),
(29193,0,0,'You\'re a monster!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Scarlet Deserter'),
(29193,1,0,'Please! Spare me! I...',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Scarlet Deserter'),
(29193,2,0,'Wi... Will it hurt?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Scarlet Deserter'),
(29193,3,0,'It tingles...',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Scarlet Deserter'),
(29193,4,0,'Why don\'t you Just Kill me Already',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Scarlet Deserter'),
(29193,5,0,'Is it too late to change my mind? How about you just kill me instead?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Scarlet Deserter'),
(29193,6,0,'The horror! THE HORROR!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Scarlet Deserter'),
(29302,0,0,'Looks like you brought the whole family! What\'s your business here, then?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Deathguard Hemil'),
(29302,1,0,'Work?  You are aware this is a warzone, citizen?  What is your profession?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Deathguard Hemil'),
(29302,2,0,'Right.  Go ahead.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Deathguard Hemil'),
(29302,3,0,'Her Majesty sends Dark Rangers! Stand aside, boys!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Deathguard Hemil'),
(29302,4,0,'You must be the sorriest bunch of recruits I\'ve seen today!  Fall in formations and report to High Executor Anselm!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Deathguard Hemil'),
(29302,4,1,'Aren\'t you a sorry sight!  I suppose you\'re a little better than yesterday\'s bunch.  Formations, now!  Report for duty!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Deathguard Hemil'),
(29302,4,2,'Wipe that worthless grin off your faces, recruits!  If the High Executor sees you like that he will kill you all himself!,',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Deathguard Hemil'),
(29394,0,0,'Not yet, Ymiron, I have other plans for you. You will serve me better within Utgarde Pinnacle. And if these insects survive to find you again, you will get the chance to avenge your wife.',14,0,100,1,0,14748,'The Lich King'),
(29419,0,0,'We\'re here for civilian work, sir.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Julian Morris'),
(29419,1,0,'Well... we\'re undertakers, sir.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Julian Morris'),
(29422,0,0,'Yes, sir!',12,0,100,66,0,0,'Forsaken Recruit'),
(29429,0,0,'Is it true?! Has someone finally come to get me out of this place?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Janks'),
(29429,1,0,'No... no... that\'s not it, is it? That heartless lout probably sent you after the tools, didn\'t he?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Janks'),
(29429,2,0,'Well... I guess I\'ll just keep an eye on the turrets... or something.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Janks'),
(29429,3,0,'%s sighs.',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Janks'),
(29437,0,0,'You go now, bad troll!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Rageclaw Berserker'),
(29437,0,1,'Why you hurt Rageclaw? You crazy?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Rageclaw Berserker'),
(29437,0,2,'Rageclaw and troll friends no more!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Rageclaw Berserker'),
(29437,0,3,'You kill our pups! We kill you back!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Rageclaw Berserker'),
(29437,0,4,'You leave den the hard way!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Rageclaw Berserker'),
(29437,0,5,'You hurted the chief\'s lion seal! WHY YOU HURT LION SEAL??!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Rageclaw Berserker'),
(29437,0,6,'Why you smell so bad now? You smelled much less bad before!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Rageclaw Berserker'),
(29437,0,7,'Trolls is shameful. Trolls is killers!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Rageclaw Berserker'),
(29439,0,0,'You go now, bad troll!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Rageclaw Hunter'),
(29439,0,1,'Why you hurt Rageclaw? You crazy?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Rageclaw Hunter'),
(29439,0,2,'Rageclaw and troll friends no more!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Rageclaw Hunter'),
(29439,0,3,'You kill our pups! We kill you back!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Rageclaw Hunter'),
(29439,0,4,'You leave den the hard way!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Rageclaw Hunter'),
(29439,0,5,'You hurted the chief\'s lion seal! WHY YOU HURT LION SEAL??!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Rageclaw Hunter'),
(29439,0,6,'Why you smell so bad now? You smelled much less bad before!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Rageclaw Hunter'),
(29439,0,7,'Trolls is shameful. Trolls is killers!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Rageclaw Hunter'),
(29611,0,0,'People of Stormwind! Citizens of the Alliance! Your king speaks!',14,7,100,22,0,0,'King Varian Wrynn');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `creature_text` (`entry`,`groupid`,`id`,`text`,`type`,`language`,`probability`,`emote`,`duration`,`sound`,`comment`) VALUES
(29611,1,0,'Today marks the first of many defeats for the Scourge! Death knights, once in service of the Lich King, have broken free of his grasp and formed a new alliance against his tyranny!',14,7,100,22,0,0,'King Varian Wrynn'),
(29611,2,0,'You will welcome these former heroes of the Alliance and treat them with the respect that you would give to any ally of Stormwind!',14,7,100,22,0,0,'King Varian Wrynn'),
(29611,3,0,'Glory to the Alliance!',14,7,100,4,0,0,'King Varian Wrynn'),
(29643,0,0,'This doesn\'t look pretty, lad.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Bailey'),
(29643,1,0,'That right? Well why don\'t you go prance your merry little self over and grab them, eh?',12,0,100,6,0,0,'Bailey'),
(29643,2,0,'That\'s strange... for a moment there, I could have swore you called me short.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Bailey'),
(29643,3,0,'Toss me?! Okay, that\'s it punk.',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Bailey'),
(29643,4,0,'Keep it to yourself.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Bailey'),
(29643,5,0,'You better hope they don\'t survive it, lad.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Bailey'),
(29643,6,0,'Cause I\'m just going to watch and laugh as they toss you in.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Bailey'),
(29643,7,0,'There\'s got to be a way in somewhere.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Bailey'),
(29643,8,0,'How\'d the goblin leave his tools there then?',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Bailey'),
(29643,9,0,'That\'s it, lad! It looks totally safe. Go for it, I\'ll be right behind ya!',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Bailey'),
(29643,10,0,'Pansy.',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Bailey'),
(29644,0,0,'I don\'t know, Bailey... it\'s not so bad. We could throw a rock at the tools from here.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Bellinger'),
(29644,1,0,'Well... I was just thinking... you\'re a bit smaller, so you\'re less likely to set off any of those mines.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Bellinger'),
(29644,2,0,'No, no, no! Not short... it\'s just... well... maybe I could toss you across most of it?',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Bellinger'),
(29644,3,0,'Ahhh!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Bellinger'),
(29644,4,0,'That was close! You scared me.',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Bellinger'),
(29644,5,0,'I\'ve got an idea, Bailey...',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Bellinger'),
(29644,6,0,'No, no - this might work!',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Bellinger'),
(29644,7,0,'There\'s a path right there... only a few mines at the end in between us and the tools.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Bellinger'),
(29644,8,0,'We wait for the next adventurer to come through and we tell him that\'s the way to go... then after they set off the mines, we just walk in and grab the tools!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Bellinger'),
(29644,9,0,'It really doesn\'t look like it, Bailey.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Bellinger'),
(29644,10,0,'Oh... good point. How about right there? That looks clear... kind of.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Bellinger'),
(29644,11,0,'Uh... that\'s okay. It still kind of hurts from last time.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Bellinger'),
(29655,0,0,'Saragosa! What has become of you?',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Malygos'),
(29677,0,0,'The %s sniffs the ground to pickup the trail.',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Frosthound to Player'),
(29677,1,0,'You\'ve been seen! Use the net and ice slick to keep the dwarves away!',42,0,100,0,0,0,'Frosthound to Player'),
(29677,2,0,'The frosthound has located the thief\'s hiding place. Confront him!',42,0,100,377,0,0,'Frosthound to Player'),
(29677,3,0,'The %s has tracked the scent to its source.',16,0,100,377,0,0,'Frosthound to Player'),
(29724,0,0,'Defragmenting swap file ...',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Library Guardian'),
(29724,0,1,'Running a level three diagnostic ...',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Library Guardian'),
(29724,0,2,'Attempting to restore lost data ...',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Library Guardian'),
(29724,0,3,'Implementing new security protocols ...',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Library Guardian'),
(29724,0,4,'Verifying encryption key ...',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Library Guardian'),
(29724,0,5,'Assessing database integrity ...',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Library Guardian'),
(29851,0,0,'You\'re the one that\'s been disrupting things? This should be easy.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'General Lightsbane'),
(29858,0,0,'My dear general, your time has come!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Lady Nightswood'),
(29859,0,0,'MRMRFRMRFRMRRRR!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'The Leaper'),
(29860,0,0,'SMASH!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Vile'),
(29903,0,0,'%s sniffs and finds the trail.',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Frostbite'),
(29903,1,0,'The iron dwarves followed you! Use the net and the ice slick to escape!',42,0,100,0,0,0,'Frostbite'),
(29903,2,0,'%s has tracked the scent to its source inside the cave.',16,0,100,377,0,0,'Frostbite'),
(29903,3,0,'Frostbite has tracked the scent to its source. Investigate the cave!',42,0,100,377,0,0,'Frostbite'),
(29915,0,0,'You call that fighting? Let me go grab your dolly. Maybe she could teach you how to swing.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Instructor Hroegar'),
(29915,0,1,'My dead grandmater, rest her soul, could beat you... even now!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Instructor Hroegar'),
(29915,0,2,'I\'ve half a mind to cut you both down where you stand! The other half isn\'t arguing!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Instructor Hroegar'),
(29915,0,3,'Well hello, ladies. What do you think this is... Skorn?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Instructor Hroegar'),
(29915,0,4,'You will practice until your lungs are bursting and your arms are aching, and then we\'ll really start!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Instructor Hroegar'),
(29915,0,5,'Only the best of the best get a shot in Valhalas to go to Ymirheim. Everyone else dies... or worse!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Instructor Hroegar'),
(29915,0,6,'Stop trying to hit him and HIT HIM already!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Instructor Hroegar'),
(29915,0,7,'Are you trying to make me look bad? That\'s the only thing that you\'re good for today!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Instructor Hroegar'),
(30197,0,0,'You have my thanks. I\'m going back to The Shadow Vault now.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),
(30197,0,1,'I\'ve tarried too long here. I must get back to The Shadow Vault. Farewell.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),
(30197,0,2,'I will see you back at The Shadow Vault.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),
(30197,0,3,'That\'s enough for me. I\'m heading back now.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),
(30197,0,4,'I\'d love to stay and kill vrykul with you all day, but I\'m sure the baron will be wondering where I am.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),
(30197,0,5,'I have to go. You stay and kill more of these ugly mongrels.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),
(30197,0,6,'Time to go. Don\'t let them capture you or they\'ll put you in the stew!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),
(30197,0,7,'I\'m heading back now. I\'ll let the baron know that you liberated me.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),
(30197,1,0,'Let\'s do this.',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),
(30197,1,1,'Thanks. How can I help?',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),
(30197,1,2,'I can fight by your side for a few minutes before I need to return to The Shadow Vault.',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),
(30197,1,3,'Thank you, $c. I owe you.',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),
(30197,1,4,'Excellent. Let\'s kill some vrykul!',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),
(30197,1,5,'It\'s time for revenge!',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),
(30197,1,6,'Where\'s my damned helmet? Well, at least they left my sword here. Idiots.',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),
(30197,1,7,'Kill!',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Ebon Blade Knight'),
