(37087,0,3,'What\'s Joren doin\' out there, anyhow?',12,7,100,6,0,0,'Jona Ironstock'),
(37106,0,0,'You gotta hurry,kid. We gotta get you into the game. But first, we gotta get the parts for that shredder!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'say Text'),
(37106,1,0,'Get into that shredder and win the game. The Bilgewater Cartel\'s counting on you!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'say Text'),
(37106,2,0,'You got the juice,kid. That\'s for sure! Too bad that dragon had to come and ruin everything. No matter. You made us proud. Now get back to headquarters.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'say Text'),
(37157,0,0,'Guards!I expect this $r to be clapped into chains!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'on Aggro Text'),
(37500,0,0,'Volcano rocks - new low price! You\'re gonna love my rocks.',14,0,50,1,0,0,'say Text'),
(37500,0,1,'Volcano rocks for sale! Hot off the mountain! You want \'em, I got \'em!',14,0,50,1,0,0,'say Text'),
(37500,0,2,'Take home a piece of the Cataclysm! Volcano rocks for sale - hot, Hot, HOT!',14,0,50,1,0,0,'say Text'),
(37500,0,3,'Get your volcano rocks here! ...Great for cats!',14,0,50,1,0,0,'say Text'),
(37500,0,4,'Volcano rocks. Million and one uses. Lava, java, sauna, banana....',14,0,50,1,0,0,'say Text'),
(37500,0,5,'Papers to weigh? Doors to stop? Windows to break? bam, Bam, BAM! Volcano rocks.',14,0,50,1,0,0,'say Text'),
(37500,0,6,'Volcano rocks! Limited time offer! Papers of authenticity and everything!',14,0,50,1,0,0,'say Text'),
