(37763,0,0,'Look at it, Lor\'themar. It is certainly Quel\'Delar.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Grand Magister Rommath to Player'),
(37763,4,0,'You will have what you have come for, $N. Take the sword and begone. And you, Auric, have a care what you say in this sacred place.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Grand Magister Rommath to Player'),
(37763,5,0,'The regent speaks truly, $n. Thalorien\'s sacrifice could not prevent the fall of this very Sunwell.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Grand Magister Rommat'),
(37763,8,0,'Reclaim the sword, $n, and bear it through that portal to Dalaran. Archmage Aethas Sunreaver will be waiting to congratulate you.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Grand Magister Rommat'),
(37765,2,0,'Carry the sword back to Dalaran through that portal, $N. You have done what many quel\'dorei have dreamt of for years. Quel\'Delar has been restored at last.',12,0,100,25,0,0,'Captain Auric Sunchaser to Player'),
