(48494,0,0,'Prepare the Micro Mechachicken!',14,0,100,1,0,0,'say Text'),
(48494,1,0,'There\'s a great deal that you do not understand, my dear Greely. That is why you are the assistant and I... I am Hobart Grapplehammer!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'say Text'),
